            "\u001b[32;1m\u001b[1;3mTo answer the question about the main causes of climate change, I need to gather comprehensive and accurate information on the topic. This will involve looking for recent studies, expert opinions, and data that outline the various factors contributing to climate change.\n",
            "\n",
